pan><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;#123abc&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></font></div></code></div><br>It has a few other features such as supporting choosing the &quot;transparent&quot; colour</div></div></div></blockquote></div></blockquote></div>"
