    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Wow, really beautiful!<div><br></div><div>I skimmed the code at it looks good--you may eventually want to get on board the htmltools::htmlDependency bus and replace <a href=\"https://github.com/daattali/shinyjs/blob/277dfee66c217a6519fa592a98ffd922ad461219/R/colourInput.R#L89-L94\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/daattali/shinyjs/blob/277dfee66c217a6519fa592a98ffd922ad461219/R/colourInput.R%23L89-L94&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792398124648000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2pY9gNGImgak75mIpgVWrc\">https://github.com/daattali/shinyjs/blob/277dfee66c217a6519fa592a98ffd922ad461219/R/colourInput.R#L89-L94</a> with a proper htmltools::attachDependencies(div(...), htmltools::htmlDependency(...)).</div></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div>"
    ],
    [
