<br>updateColourInput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;col&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> value </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;#123abc&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></font></div></code></div><br>It has a few other features such as supporting choosing the &quot;transparent&quot; colour</div></div></div></blockquote></div></blockquote></div>\r\n\r\n<p></p></blockquote></div>"
